Why Is Demand Increasing
• Rising health consciousness — Consumer awareness of the benefits associated with monounsaturated fats and polyphenols is supporting demand for olive oil.

• Premiumization — Premium and organic olive oil products are gaining importance as consumers increasingly value quality, certification and product origin.

• Mediterranean diet adoption — Broader adoption of Mediterranean dietary patterns is increasing international interest in authentic olive oil products.

Food & Wellness Industry Watch: Premiumization and Traceability Reshape Olive Oil
The olive oil market is increasingly influenced by demand for premium extra virgin varieties. Consumers associate extra virgin olive oil with culinary authenticity, sensory quality and health-related benefits. Producers are responding through cold-press technologies, origin-specific labeling and premium packaging.

Sustainability and traceability are also becoming increasingly relevant. Digital platforms and QR-enabled packaging can provide information about orchard origin, harvest dates and processing methods. These initiatives support product authenticity and consumer confidence while helping producers respond to environmental expectations and regulatory requirements.

